<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4.1 Evaluation Results on VeroEval ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">State-of-the-art performance with a fully-open RL recipe.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.1 Evaluation Results on VeroEval ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Consistent gains across base models, beating proprietary recipes.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.1 Evaluation Results on VeroEval ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Improvements not limited to a single domain.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS1.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.1 Evaluation Results on VeroEval ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Consistent advantage over prior open RL datasets across training.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>Ablations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="In 4.2 Ablations ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Multi-task RL requires more expressive reward design.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.2 Ablations ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Our data benefits most from RL, yet even with SFT alone it outperforms strong SFT baselines.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.2 Ablations ‣ Section 4 Experiments ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">GSPO outperforms GRPO and DAPO and leads to more stable entropy.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Data Diversity &amp; Cross-Task Transfer</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
