<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Section 5 Data Diversity &amp; Cross-Task Transfer ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Task categories elicit markedly different reasoning lengths.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Section 5 Data Diversity &amp; Cross-Task Transfer ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Diverse task mixing eliminates negative cross-task transfer.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Section 5 Data Diversity &amp; Cross-Task Transfer ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Broader exposure to the mixed training distribution yields continued gains.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
