<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1976D2;">Vero</span>: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="id2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Gabriel Sarch<sup id="id2.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗</span></sup>  Linrong Cai<sup id="id2.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">∗</span></sup>  Qunzhong Wang  Haoyang Wu</span>
<span id="id2.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Danqi Chen  Zhuang Liu<sup id="id2.2.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup></span>
</span>

<br class="ltx_break">
Princeton University
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
