</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Evaluation Datasets</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table A2 ‣ A.2 Evaluation Datasets ‣ Appendix A Dataset Details ‣ Vero: An Open RL Recipe for General Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A2</span></a>, we summarize the 30 evaluation benchmarks in <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1976D2;">VeroEval</span> and give a short description of what each benchmark tests.</p>
</div>
