<span id="A1.T3.3.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T3.3.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Scientific notation or symbolic algebraic expressions outside our numeric parser’s scope.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.3.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.7pt 4.0pt;">
