<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Backtracking</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Identify unproductive paths and return to earlier decision points.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:52.4pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Backward Chaining</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Start with goals and work backward to identify prerequisites.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:52.4pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Causal Organization</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Arrange elements through cause-effect relationships.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:52.4pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Compositionality</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Build complex ideas from simpler components.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:52.4pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Conceptual Level Processing</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Reason with abstract concepts before translating to linguistic forms.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SSx1.p2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
