</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.3.62.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.3.62.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.3.62.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.3.62.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Provide accurate answers that account for regional variability.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.3.63" class="ltx_tr">
