<span id="A4.T2.3.63.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.3.63.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Link symptoms to underlying causes based on known patterns.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
