<span id="A4.T2.3.68.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.3.68.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.3.68.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Clarify meanings of terms used in misleading or unclear ways.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.3.69" class="ltx_tr">
