<span id="A4.T2.4.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Assess Visual Indicators</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.4.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Draw conclusions based on the absence of specific indicators.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:49.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Associative Mapping</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.4.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Associate text/marks with functional roles like brand names.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:49.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Assume Standard Conventions</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.4.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Assume standard response forms when multiple interpretations exist.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:49.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Assume Standard Dimensions</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.4.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Account for device scaling by estimating relative coordinates.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:49.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.10.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Check For Duplicates</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.4.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Verify that an element is the only one matching a requirement.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:49.0pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Color Analysis</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T2.4.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Analyze color properties to determine object relationships.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T2.4.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:49.0pt;">
