<span id="A4.T2.4.57.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T2.4.57.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.57.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Integrate visual and text info to resolve ambiguities.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.58" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T2.4.58.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.6pt 1.5pt;" colspan="2"><span id="A4.T2.4.58.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">Spatial &amp; Action</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.59" class="ltx_tr">
