<span id="A4.T2.4.63.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A4.T2.4.63.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">List all elements in a specific position within an arrangement.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T2.4.64" class="ltx_tr">
